  "summary": "Constructor for a large UI control window object. Zeroes the leading callback/state dwords and byte flag, then initializes a large array of per-sub-control blocks (~200): each block is seeded with sentinel defaults via InitWithSentinelValues, given a vtable pointer from a fixed table (off_5ACB6C..off_5ACBFC), has its state dword(s) reset to 0 and its target/sentinel dword(s) set to -1 (no target). Uses repeated 7-element constructor loops (stride 36/24) and the sub_401000 batch helper to run constructors over many blocks, finishes with a large trailing zero-init, tail flag clears, and PlayerOptionsInitializer(this). Returns this. Invoked by ProfileAlreadyExistsPageHandler.",
